# Baseline binary assets are distributed through the registry, not this Git tree.

# Tracked unified diffs under patches/ must keep their exact bytes.
# With core.autocrlf=true a normal text checkout rewrites every line to CRLF,
# which destroys the hunk context and makes `git apply -p1` fail at repack time.
# `-text` disables all EOL conversion for these files on every platform.
#
# 2026-10-20 实测：main 上 dsh-plugin-wallpaper-engine 的补丁是 CRLF（另两个是
# LF），而 npm 解包出的 lib/client.js 是 LF，于是 repack 报
# `error: patch failed: lib/client.js:4795 / patch does not apply` 并 fail-closed
# 中断。补丁内容本身正确 —— 归一化行尾后重建的 0.6.7 产物为 794329 B /
# f2f25810…，与 bootstrap.json 里登记的摘要逐字节一致。
patches/**/*.diff -text
